      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, main text",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp; ] To my most honoured, esteemed, noble, dear father //al-H\u0323a\u0304jj Muh\u0323ammad//,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp; ] ...after offering greetings and sincere prayers, now then:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My dear father, this time, 275 qint\u0323a\u0304rs of firewood were sent with the navigator \u02bfAbdalla\u0304h Ans\u0323a\u0304ri\u0304 Sa\u02bfi\u0304di\u0304.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When they arrive, take possession of them.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My dear father, in this manner</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>take possession of them and record them in your register,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and the Mevlevi\u0304 dervishes</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>on the occasion of the navigator&rsquo;s sojourn there [lit., &lsquo;on that side&rsquo;]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>...</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
