          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\u02bfAbdull\u0101h En\u1e63\u0101r\u012b Sa\u02bf\u012bd\u012b</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">F\u012b&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; odun</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u0662\u0667&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\u1e33an\u1e6d\u0101r</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \u0662\u0667\u0665 [&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[\u0667\u0664\u0662\u0665]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[navl\u016b]n [ba\u1e25]r\u012b</li></ol>\n",
