          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, bottom, middle of the page",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>\u02bfAbdalla\u0304h Ans\u0323a\u0304ri\u0304 Sa\u02bfi\u0304di\u0304</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[price] per [qint\u0323a\u0304r]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;firewood</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>27 [pa\u0304ras?]&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;qint\u0323a\u0304rs</p>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 27[5] [&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</li>\n<li>\n<p>[total:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 7425]</p>\n</li>\n<li>[shipp]ing [cost]s</li></ol>\n",
