      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin, upside-down",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ve benim peder-i \u02bfazi\u0304zim [&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&lsquo;s\u0327eyleri in s\u0327a\u0304\u02be Alla\u0304h te\u02bfa\u0304la\u0304 [&nbsp; &nbsp; ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>i\u0304rsa\u0304l ideriz h\u032eat\u0323\u0131r\u0131m\u0131zda&rsquo; di\u0304r [?] ve ol [t\u0323arafda]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Seydi\u0304 Muh\u0323ammed&rsquo;e ve Seydi\u0304 \u02bfO\u0308mer&rsquo;e sela\u0304m[lar].</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
